1
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,370
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,000
[Episode 1]

3
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:34,810
[Year 2000]

4
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,670
The heavens stretch beyond sight.

5
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:54,110
The earth lies deep in shadow.

6
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:55,110
Let the Eight Winds show the way.

7
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:56,470
Let the Lord of Fate descend.

8
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:57,790
Incense smoke rises
in seal-script patterns.

9
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,920
The ritual drum calls to the spirits.

10
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,110
This disciple humbly beseeches you.

11
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:02,310
Let all things reveal their true forms.

12
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:05,230
Cursed bonds.

13
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,520
Countless cursed bonds

14
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,280
have been reborn through you.

15
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:07,950
Again and again,

16
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:09,080
with no end in sight.

17
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,120
The cursed bond that has endured

18
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,370
through countless lives

19
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:13,840
has turned into resentment.

20
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,120
Now that this resentment clings to you,

21
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,720
you cannot escape your doom.

22
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:20,350
Will I die?

23
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,789
Of course.

24
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,200
Scared now?

25
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:25,650
I can perform rituals
to drive out evil spirits.

26
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:26,710
I charge this much.

27
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,600
Are you talking about me?

28
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,320
Supreme Lord Lao, heed my command!

29
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,340
Begone! Disperse!

30
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:53,150
Don't come any closer.

31
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:53,640
Don't come any closer!

32
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,280
Don't come any closer!

33
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,070
Let go of me!

34
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,479
Supreme Lord Lao, save me!

35
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:59,229
Let go of me! Let go!

36
00:01:59,789 --> 00:02:01,510
Go away! Don't touch me!

37
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:10,460
You little fraud.

38
00:02:11,590 --> 00:02:12,990
Your acting is terrible.

39
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,350
And you're a coward too.

40
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:18,390
You tricked me!

41
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:19,810
You'll pay for this someday.

42
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:20,650
Pay for it?

43
00:02:24,070 --> 00:02:27,530
Only those who will be reincarnated
have to fear retribution.

44
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:29,990
Where's Chen Xiugu?

45
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,250
Tell her to come out.

46
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:33,920
My grandma?

47
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:34,800
She's not here.

48
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,190
Who are you?

49
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:37,430
Song Yiqiu.

50
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,260
I've come to collect
what I asked her to find.

51
00:02:49,930 --> 00:02:50,850
Come with me.

52
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,520
You...

53
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:17,560
You...

54
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,220
The person in the photo

55
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:22,680
standing beside my grandma...

56
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,520
It's you.

57
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,730
But that photo

58
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:27,860
was taken when my grandma was young.

59
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,560
That was over 70 years ago.

60
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:31,340
Could it be that the person I just saw

61
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,070
was you from the same lifetime?

62
00:03:33,870 --> 00:03:35,800
How can you possibly not have aged?

63
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:37,700
You...

64
00:03:38,130 --> 00:03:39,620
Are you human or a ghost?

65
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,020
Don't make such a fuss.

66
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:52,530
You're so young.

67
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,040
Cut back on those smoke cakes.

68
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,640
They're bad for your health.

69
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:59,160
Take this money.

70
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:02,430
And don't trick people again.

71
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,130
Tell Xiugu

72
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,290
I got what I came for.

73
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,610
I'll come by for tea another day.

74
00:04:08,610 --> 00:04:10,210
I don't think I was mistaken.

75
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,490
Your face bears the mark of death.

76
00:04:12,490 --> 00:04:14,820
The face of someone
who is destined to die.

77
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,240
Thank you for your concern.

78
00:04:22,089 --> 00:04:24,020
I truly don't want to live anymore.

79
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,550
But I can't die yet.

80
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,720
If I die, I'll have to see him.

81
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:33,510
Some people

82
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:35,390
are better left unseen.

83
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:47,460
[72 years ago]

84
00:04:47,490 --> 00:04:47,880
Here.

85
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:48,920
Try it.

86
00:04:48,659 --> 00:04:50,409
[Chen Xiugu]

87
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,180
It's fresh tea.

88
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:53,090
It is said
that during the reign of Southern Qin,

89
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:55,080
an ancient tree attained
spiritual consciousness.

90
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,200
Its tree core

91
00:04:56,230 --> 00:04:57,870
was said to possess
the power to grant immortality.

92
00:04:57,870 --> 00:04:58,720
And then?

93
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,610
There was a couple deeply in love.

94
00:05:01,250 --> 00:05:02,520
By a twist of fate,

95
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:04,340
they formed a pact with that tree spirit.

96
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:06,270
The tree spirit sealed their years

97
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,170
within a sacred map.

98
00:05:08,510 --> 00:05:10,750
And the two became immortal.

99
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:12,480
Xiugu,

100
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:15,510
help me find a way
to end this immortality.

101
00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:16,440
All right.

102
00:05:29,130 --> 00:05:31,010
For Miss Yiqiu.

103
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,020
To break free
from the bonds of immortality,

104
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:36,350
you must find the map of the pact.

105
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:39,400
Yet the osmanthus tree
has a spirit of its own.

106
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:44,040
Only when the two who made the pact
are connected in heart and soul

107
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:45,890
and return to where it all began

108
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,190
will the map reveal itself.

109
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,070
Where it all began.

110
00:05:53,430 --> 00:05:55,030
Xiugu.

111
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:57,430
That person and I

112
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:59,159
are the two people in this world

113
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:02,290
least likely to ever return
to where we began.

114
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,570
Welcome to FM 23.3,

115
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,070
City Life Radio.

116
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:06,720
No need to pick me up.

117
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:09,430
Tonight, we are about to
witness a rare blood moon.

118
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:12,120
It happens to coincide
with the city's grand fireworks show.

119
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,510
Let's witness this moment together.

120
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,070
Ten.

121
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,070
Nine.

122
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,070
Eight.

123
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:19,000
Seven.

124
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,120
Six.

125
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,310
Five.

126
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:22,310
Four.

127
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:23,310
Three.

128
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:24,310
Two.

129
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,270
One.

130
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:06,740
Hello, is this 120?

131
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,470
There's been a traffic accident

132
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:09,530
at this intersection downtown.

133
00:07:09,530 --> 00:07:10,680
Someone's been injured.

134
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:13,860
And there's a pregnant woman
who looks like she's about to give birth.

135
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:15,500
That little fraud.

136
00:07:16,490 --> 00:07:18,490
She's got some tricks up her sleeve.

137
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:41,310
Make way.

138
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,320
Quick!

139
00:07:43,170 --> 00:07:44,320
Prepare the trauma room.

140
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,780
Severe traffic accident.

141
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:47,380
Female patient is unconscious.

142
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:48,240
Multiple fractures,

143
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,640
with internal bleeding.

144
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,940
Get OB-GYN down here
for an emergency consult.

145
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:53,560
Full-term patient
with premature rupture of membranes.

146
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,360
Transfer her
to the delivery room immediately.

147
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,159
This way.

148
00:07:56,150 --> 00:07:58,550
Don't stop. Keep doing chest compressions.

149
00:07:58,550 --> 00:08:01,110
Patient has severe trauma
and hemorrhagic shock.

150
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:01,990
Move faster.

151
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:09,130
We still can't get
a blood pressure reading.

152
00:08:10,690 --> 00:08:11,610
The monitor.

153
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,600
Vital signs are gone.

154
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:22,930
Her heart rate is back.

155
00:08:22,930 --> 00:08:24,410
Spontaneous cardiac rhythm.

156
00:08:24,410 --> 00:08:25,070
How is that possible?

157
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:25,600
Her wounds...

158
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,310
They're healing on their own.

159
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,000
H-How is that possible?

160
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,260
How could this happen?

161
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,850
She's alive!

162
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:34,700
A monster.

163
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:35,780
What a nuisance.

164
00:10:10,110 --> 00:10:12,840
♪ Because I look up to the sky,
thinking about you ♪

165
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:17,540
♪ Hoping to start anew,
and journey through with you ♪

166
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:22,570
♪ If we're destined to fall ♪

167
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Just ahead.

168
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,280
Okay.

169
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:29,040
♪ I'll be there beside you ♪

170
00:10:29,070 --> 00:10:31,790
♪ Because I look up to the sky,
thinking about you ♪

171
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:36,790
♪ Hoping to start anew,
and journey through with you ♪

172
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:42,080
♪ If we're destined to fall ♪

173
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:44,370
Wait.

174
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:00,360
As long as they're safe.

175
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:47,880
Long time no see,

176
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:49,090
Song Yiqiu.

177
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:52,980
Is it?

178
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,220
Has it really been that long?

179
00:11:56,690 --> 00:11:59,210
Seventy-two years and thirty-seven days.

180
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:02,310
For an ordinary person, 72 years

181
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:03,460
is a lifetime.

182
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:07,460
But for you and me,
after living 3,000 years,

183
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:09,950
it's nothing but a fleeting moment.

184
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:15,580
What?

185
00:12:16,370 --> 00:12:17,740
Miss me already?

186
00:12:19,850 --> 00:12:21,000
I'm just marveling.

187
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,540
You managed to stay alive
for that long without dying.

188
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,370
I suppose the world
has been too good.

189
00:12:26,370 --> 00:12:28,600
So you've encountered too few misfortunes.

190
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,240
Miss Meddler.

191
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:44,070
You just died once.

192
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,490
Whenever one of us dies,

193
00:12:45,490 --> 00:12:47,850
we appear by the other's side.

194
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:49,530
Could it be

195
00:12:49,870 --> 00:12:50,920
that I've simply grown tired

196
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:53,920
of looking at the same face
you've had for 3,000 years?

197
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:55,820
Song Yiqiu.

198
00:12:57,810 --> 00:12:58,850
Ning Changyue.

199
00:12:59,860 --> 00:13:01,180
Long time no see.

200
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,510
Do you dare to experience
the feeling of falling

201
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,880
with me one more time?

202
00:13:08,270 --> 00:13:10,200
Someone's holding a wedding here today.

203
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:10,960
It's a joyous occasion.

204
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:13,090
Don't die on someone else's doorstep.

205
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:36,510
Three thousand years have passed.

206
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,950
Every story has reached its ending.

207
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:40,990
Except ours.

208
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:44,370
We became prisoners forgotten by time.

209
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,030
Long, long ago,

210
00:13:48,970 --> 00:13:51,100
I thought immortality was a blessing.

211
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:55,200
But after countless encounters
with desolate graves,

212
00:13:55,370 --> 00:13:57,220
heart-wrenching farewells,

213
00:13:57,410 --> 00:13:59,610
and the agony of dying only to be reborn,

214
00:14:00,450 --> 00:14:01,650
I finally understood

215
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:03,400
immortality

216
00:14:04,270 --> 00:14:06,220
is a curse with no escape.

217
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:15,610
Granny Xiugu.

218
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,370
[Three months later]

219
00:14:24,790 --> 00:14:26,740
Why is she wearing red?

220
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,870
It's you.

221
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:45,210
I never thought

222
00:14:45,430 --> 00:14:47,890
we'd meet again under these circumstances.

223
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:59,030
Xiugu.

224
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,860
I still remember you telling me
when you were little

225
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:05,720
that you loved this robe of mine
more than anything.

226
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:08,850
Too bad you became a fortune-teller.

227
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:12,010
You were never
meant to wear red in this life.

228
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,200
Xiugu.

229
00:15:34,770 --> 00:15:36,720
This robe is yours now.

230
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:38,670
In your next life,

231
00:15:39,380 --> 00:15:41,300
wear whatever color you like.

232
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:57,520
Granny Xiugu, may you go peacefully.

233
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,500
Three thousand years,

234
00:16:02,930 --> 00:16:05,970
and you've witnessed so many
births, deaths, and separations.

235
00:16:05,970 --> 00:16:07,830
And yet you can still feel sorrow.

236
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,670
I'm not like you.

237
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:15,860
After all, your heart holds only yourself.

238
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:18,450
You have never cared about anyone else.

239
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:23,030
To you, all living things
are no more than ants.

240
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:27,030
Whether they live or die
makes no difference.

241
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:30,340
There isn't much that I can fit

242
00:16:32,130 --> 00:16:33,100
in my heart.

243
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,870
Not like you.

244
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:45,750
Your country, your people,
the whole world,

245
00:16:45,750 --> 00:16:47,550
every common soul under heaven,

246
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:51,120
even every stray cat and dog
by the roadside...

247
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:53,450
Is there anything
you could ever let go of?

248
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:59,120
Sometimes I truly can't understand

249
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,920
how I ever ended up
jumping off that cliff with you.

250
00:17:06,530 --> 00:17:07,329
Yeah.

251
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,680
Why

252
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,260
was it me of all people?

253
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:21,069
The princess has fled with her guard.

254
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:23,160
The emperor has ordered her capture.

255
00:17:22,829 --> 00:17:26,520
[3,000 years ago]

256
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,750
Dead or alive.

257
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:26,440
After them!

258
00:17:27,990 --> 00:17:28,800
Watch out!

259
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,000
Quick, there!

260
00:17:33,750 --> 00:17:35,480
That's a cliff. They can't escape now.

261
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,070
Let's go!

262
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:36,920
Hurry!

263
00:17:49,030 --> 00:17:50,160
Are you afraid?

264
00:17:50,730 --> 00:17:52,190
As long as I'm by your side,

265
00:17:52,410 --> 00:17:54,140
I have nothing left to wish for.

266
00:17:59,530 --> 00:18:00,480
Song Yiqiu,

267
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,830
from this day forward,

268
00:18:04,090 --> 00:18:06,480
from the heavens above
to the depths below,

269
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,960
may it always be you and me,

270
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,110
never to part.

271
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:12,750
We

272
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:15,160
will never part.

273
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:34,670
♪ I'd forsake immortality
to share your joys and sorrows ♪

274
00:18:34,690 --> 00:18:37,640
♪ Who cares how absurd eternity may be ♪

275
00:18:37,670 --> 00:18:43,220
♪ I'd trade this life for eternity ♪

276
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:47,910
♪ Then we'd be complete ♪

277
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:46,660
Song Yiqiu.

278
00:18:48,270 --> 00:18:49,400
Let's

279
00:18:51,330 --> 00:18:52,480
be together again.

280
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:59,240
Now we know that the tree spirit
belongs to the Osmanthus Clan.

281
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,710
We have to find the map of our pact

282
00:19:00,710 --> 00:19:01,970
and return to where it all began.

283
00:19:01,970 --> 00:19:04,030
Only then can we end our immortality.

284
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:07,880
So?

285
